          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii oo dhammuna way wada arkeen onkodkii iyo hillaacii, iyo codkii buunka, iyo buurtii qiiqaysay; oo markii dadkii arkay ayay gariireen, oo meel fog istaageen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasay waxay Muuse ku yidhaahdeen, Adigu nala hadal, oo annana waannu ku maqli doonnaa, laakiinse Ilaah yuusan nala hadlin, waaba intaasoo aannu dhimannaaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Muuse wuxuu dadkii ku yidhi, Ha cabsanina, waayo, Ilaah wuxuu u yimid inuu idin tijaabiyo, iyo in ka cabsashadiisu idinku jirto, si aydnaan u dembaabin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii waxay istaageen meel fog, Muusena wuxuu u soo dhowaaday gudcurkii qarada weynaa oo Ilaah joogay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
